<title>USA: United Security Bancorp names auditors.</title>
<headline>United Security Bancorp names auditors.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Security Bancorp said Friday it has retained Moss Adams LLP as its independent auditing firm and business advisers.</p>
<p>The appointment is effective immediately.</p>
<p>USBN's previous auditor was McFarland &amp; Alton PS of Spokane.</p>
<p>It could not be immediately determined what happened to the company's relationship with McFarland &amp; Alton. The company was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>United Security is a bank holding company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
